    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   丧家犬就这样灰溜溜的跑回来了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "丧家犬就这样灰溜溜的跑回来了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  我可不属于你们这种下等种族哦。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "我可不属于你们这种下等种族哦。"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   ——如果你不是成功完成了任务，我一定让你这张脸上多添一两道疤。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "——如果你不是成功完成了任务，我一定让你这张脸上多添一两道疤。"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  麻烦被炸的手足全失的小孩子用嘴来为我化妆，真过意不去呢。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "麻烦被炸的手足全失的小孩子用嘴来为我化妆，真过意不去呢。"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   呵。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "呵。"
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  我们两个斗嘴——可是没什么好处的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "我们两个斗嘴——可是没什么好处的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   我姑且承认了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "我姑且承认了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   那么，鱼上钩了？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "那么，鱼上钩了？"
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  一定。就看爱国者那个老家伙能不能把真货带回去了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "一定。就看爱国者那个老家伙能不能把真货带回去了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  说起来，你还挺怕这老头的吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "说起来，你还挺怕这老头的吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#3\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   我心情已经有些不太好了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "我心情已经有些不太好了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#3\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  哎呀，抱歉。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "哎呀，抱歉。"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  不过在钓上大鱼之前，对吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "不过在钓上大鱼之前，对吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"W\"]  要么我们俩，就先相互忍耐一下吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "W",
        "content": "要么我们俩，就先相互忍耐一下吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1504_cqbw\", name2=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\", focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw.png",
        "name2": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   哼。是啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "哼。是啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   我先得解决这些小的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "我先得解决这些小的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   罗德岛的几位，出来吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "罗德岛的几位，出来吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"梅菲斯特\"]   ——想要在我面前隐藏自己，是绝对不可能的哦。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "梅菲斯特",
        "content": "——想要在我面前隐藏自己，是绝对不可能的哦。"
    },
